{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-1","title":"2 Samuel 22:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>1 David's psalm of thanksgiving for God's powerful deliverance, and manifold blessings.</p>\n<p>David. Ps 50:14; 103:1-6; 116:1-19 words. Ex 15:1; Jud 5:1 in. 49; Ps 18:1; *title Ps 34:19; Isa 12:1-6; 2Co 1:10; 2Ti 4:18; Re 7:9-17 and out. 1Sa 23:14; 24:15; 25:29; 26:24; 27:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-2","title":"2 Samuel 22:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>De 32:4; 1Sa 2:2; Ps 18:2-50; 31:3; 42:9; 71:3; 91:2; 144:2; Mt 16:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-3","title":"2 Samuel 22:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>in him. Heb 2:13 shield. Ge 15:1; De 33:29; Ps 3:3; 5:12; 28:7; 84:9,11; 115:9-11; Pr 30:5 the horn. 1Sa 2:1; Lu 1:69 my high. 51; Ps 61:3; 144:2; Pr 18:10 my refuge. Ps 9:9; 14:6; 18:2; 27:5; 32:7; 46:1,7,11; 59:16; 71:7; 142:4 Isa 32:2; Jer 16:9 my saviour. Isa 12:2; 45:21; Lu 1:47,71; Tit 3:4,6 thou savest. 49; Ps 55:9; 72:14; 86:14; 140:1,4,11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-4","title":"2 Samuel 22:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>I will. Ps 116:2,4,13,17 worthy. Ne 9:5; Ps 18:3; 66:2; 106:2; 148:1-4; Re 4:11; 5:12 so. Ps 34:6; 50:15; 55:16; 56:9; 57:1-3; Ro 10:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-5","title":"2 Samuel 22:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>waves. or, pangs. 1Th 5:3 the floods. Ps 18:4; 69:14,15; 93:3,4; Isa 59:19; Jer 46:7,8; Re 12:15,16 Re 17:1,15 ungodly men. Heb. Belial.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-6","title":"2 Samuel 22:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>sorrows. or, cords. Job 36:8; Ps 18:5; 116:3; 140:5; Pr 5:22; Jon 2:2; Ac 2:24 the snares. Pr 13:14; 14:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-7","title":"2 Samuel 22:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>my distress. Ps 116:4; 120:1; Mt 26:38,39; Lu 22:44; Heb 5:7 did hear. Ex 3:7; Ps 34:6,15-17 out. 1Ki 8:28-30; Ps 18:6; 27:4; Jon 2:4,7; Hab 2:20 my cry. Jas 5:4</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-8","title":"2 Samuel 22:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>the earth. Jud 5:4; Ps 18:7; 77:18; 97:4; Hab 3:6-11; Mt 27:51; 28:2; Ac 4:31 foundations. Job 26:11; Na 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-9","title":"2 Samuel 22:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>went. 16; Ex 15:7,8; 19:18; 24:17; De 32:22; Job 4:9; 41:20,21; Ps 18:8,15 Ps 97:3-5; Isa 30:27,33; Jer 5:14; 15:14; Heb 12:29 out of his. Heb. by his, etc. coals. Hab 3:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-10","title":"2 Samuel 22:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>bowed. Ps 144:5; Isa 64:1-3 darkness. Ex 20:21; De 4:11; 1Ki 8:12; Ps 97:2; 104:3; Mt 27:45; Lu 23:44,45</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-11","title":"2 Samuel 22:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>a cherub. Ge 3:24; Ex 25:19; 1Sa 4:4; Ps 18:10; 68:17; 80:1; 99:1; Eze 9:3 Eze 10:2-14; Heb 1:14 upon the. Ps 104:3; 139:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-12","title":"2 Samuel 22:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>made. 10; Ps 18:11,12; 27:5; 97:2 dark waters. Heb. binding waters.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-13","title":"2 Samuel 22:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>coals of fire. 9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-14","title":"2 Samuel 22:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>thundered. Ex 19:6; Jud 5:20; 1Sa 2:10; 7:10; 12:17,18; Job 37:2-5; 40:9 Ps 29:3-9; 77:16-19; Isa 30:30; Eze 10:5; Re 11:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-15","title":"2 Samuel 22:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>arrows. De 32:23; Jos 10:10; Ps 7:12,13; 18:14; 45:5; 144:6,7; Hab 3:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-16","title":"2 Samuel 22:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>the channels. Ex 14:21-27; 15:8-10; Ps 18:15-17; 114:3-7 rebuking. Ex 15:8; Job 38:11; Ps 106:9; Na 1:4; Hab 3:8-10; Mt 8:26,27 nostrils. or, anger. 9; Ps 74:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-17","title":"2 Samuel 22:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>sent. Ps 18:16; 144:7 he drew. Ps 32:6; 59:1,2; 93:3,4; 124:4,5; 130:1; Isa 43:2; La 3:54; Re 17:15 many. or, great.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-18","title":"2 Samuel 22:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>delivered. 1; Ps 3:7; 56:9; 2Co 1:10; 2Ti 4:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-19","title":"2 Samuel 22:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>prevented. 15:10-13; 1Sa 19:11-17; 23:26,27; Ps 18:18,19; 118:10-13 Mt 27:39-44 the Lord. Ps 71:20,21; Isa 26:19; 50:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-20","title":"2 Samuel 22:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>brought. Ge 26:22; 1Ch 4:10; Ps 31:8; 118:5; Ho 4:16 delighted. 15:26; Ps 22:8; 147:11; 149:4; Isa 42:1; Mt 3:17; 17:5; 27:43 Ac 2:32-36</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-21","title":"2 Samuel 22:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>rewarded. 25; 1Sa 26:23; 1Ki 8:32; Ps 7:3,4,8; 18:20-25; 19:11; 1Co 15:58 cleanness. Job 17:9; Ps 24:4; Jas 4:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-22","title":"2 Samuel 22:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>I have kept. Nu 16:15; 1Sa 12:3; Job 23:10-12; 2Co 1:12 the ways. Ge 18:19; Ps 119:1; 128:1; Pr 8:32 have not. Ps 36:3; 125:5; Zep 1:6; Joh 15:10; Heb 10:38,39</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-23","title":"2 Samuel 22:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>For all. Ps 119:6,86,128; Lu 1:6; Joh 15:14 judgments. De 6:1,2; 7:12; Ps 19:8,9; 119:13,30,102 I did not. De 8:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-24","title":"2 Samuel 22:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>upright. Ge 6:9; 17:1; Job 1:1; Ps 51:6; 84:11; Joh 1:47; 2Co 5:11 before him. Heb. to him. kept. Pr 4:23; Heb 12:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-25","title":"2 Samuel 22:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>recompensed. 21; Isa 3:10; Ro 2:7,8; 2Co 5:10 in his eye sight. Heb. before his eyes. Pr 5:21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-26","title":"2 Samuel 22:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>the merciful. Mt 5:7; Jas 2:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-27","title":"2 Samuel 22:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>the pure. Mt 5:8 forward. Le 26:23-28; De 28:58-61; Ps 125:5 shew thyself unsavoury. or, wrestle. Ex 18:11; Ps 18:26; Isa 45:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-28","title":"2 Samuel 22:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>afflicted. Ex 3:7,8; Ps 12:5; 72:12,13; 140:12; Isa 61:1-3; 63:9; Mt 5:3 but thine. Ex 9:14-17; 10:3; 18:11; Job 40:11,12; Ps 138:6; Pr 21:4; Isa 2:11 Isa 5:15; 37:23,28,29; Da 4:37; Jas 4:6,7; 1Pe 5:5,6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-29","title":"2 Samuel 22:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>lamp. or, candle. Job 29:3; Ps 27:1; 84:11; Joh 8:12; Re 21:23 lighten. Ps 4:6; 18:28; 97:11; 112:4; Isa 50:10; 60:19,20; Mic 7:9; Mal 4:2 Joh 12:46</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-30","title":"2 Samuel 22:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>run through. or, broken. Ps 18:29; 118:10-12; Ro 8:37; Php 4:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-31","title":"2 Samuel 22:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>his way. De 32:4; Da 4:37; Mt 5:48; Re 15:3 the word. Ps 12:6; 18:30; 119:140; Pr 30:5 tried. or, refined. a buckler. 3; Ps 35:2; 91:4; 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-32","title":"2 Samuel 22:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>For who. De 32:31,39; 1Sa 2:2; Isa 44:6,8; 45:5,6,21; Jer 10:6,7,16 a rock. 2,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-33","title":"2 Samuel 22:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>strength. Ex 15:2; Ps 18:32; 27:1; 28:7,8; 31:4; 46:1; Isa 41:10; Zec 10:12 2Co 12:9; Eph 6:10; Php 4:13 maketh. Heb. riddeth, or looseth. my way. Heb 13:21 perfect. De 18:13; Job 22:3; Ps 101:2,6; 119:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-34","title":"2 Samuel 22:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>maketh. Heb. equalleth to. like hinds'. 2:18; De 33:25; Hab 3:19 setteth. De 32:13; Isa 33:16; 58:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-35","title":"2 Samuel 22:35","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":35,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":35},"content":"<p>teacheth. Ps 18:33,34; 144:1 to war. Heb. for the war. a bow. Ps 46:9; Eze 39:3,9,10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-36","title":"2 Samuel 22:36","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":36,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":36},"content":"<p>the shield. Ge 15:1; Ps 84:11; Eph 6:16 gentleness. Ps 18:35 made me great. Heb. multiplied me. Ge 12:2; 22:17; Ps 115:14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-37","title":"2 Samuel 22:37","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":37,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":37},"content":"<p>enlarged. Ps 4:1; 18:36; Pr 4:12 feet. Heb. ankles. 1Sa 2:9; Ps 17:5; 94:18; 121:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-38","title":"2 Samuel 22:38","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":38,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":38},"content":"<p>5:18-25; 8:1,2,13,14; 10:14; Ps 21:8,9; Ro 8:37</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-39","title":"2 Samuel 22:39","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":39,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":39},"content":"<p>Ps 18:37; 110:1,5,6; 118:10-12; Mal 4:1,3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-40","title":"2 Samuel 22:40","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":40,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":40},"content":"<p>girded. 1Sa 17:49-51; 23:5; Ps 18:32,39; Isa 45:5; Col 1:11 them. Ps 44:5; 144:2 subdued. Heb. caused to bow. Isa 60:14; Re 5:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-41","title":"2 Samuel 22:41","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":41,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":41},"content":"<p>necks. Ge 49:8; Ex 23:27; Jos 10:24; Ps 18:40,41 I might. Ps 21:8,9; Lu 19:14,27; 2Th 1:8,9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-42","title":"2 Samuel 22:42","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":42,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":42},"content":"<p>unto the Lord. 1Sa 28:6; Job 27:9; Pr 1:28; Isa 1:15; Eze 20:3; Mic 3:4 Mt 7:22,23; Lu 13:25,26</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-43","title":"2 Samuel 22:43","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":43,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":43},"content":"<p>as small. 2Ki 13:7; Ps 35:5; Da 2:35; Mal 4:1 as the mire. Ps 18:42; Isa 10:6; Mic 7:10; Zec 10:5 did spread. De 32:26; Isa 26:15; Zec 2:6; Lu 21:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-44","title":"2 Samuel 22:44","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":44,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":44},"content":"<p>delivered. 3:1; 5:1; 18:6-8; 19:9,14; 20:1,2,22; Ps 2:1-6; 18:43; Ac 4:25-28 Ac 5:30,31 head. 8:1-14; De 28:13; Ps 2:8; 60:8,9; 72:8,9; 110:6; Isa 60:12; Da 7:14 Ro 15:12; Re 11:15 a people. Isa 55:5; 65:1; Ho 2:23; Ro 9:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-45","title":"2 Samuel 22:45","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":45,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":45},"content":"<p>Strangers. Heb. Sons of the stranger. Isa 56:3,6 submit themselves. or, yield feigned obedience. Heb. lie. De 33:29; Ps 18:44,45; 66:3; 81:15; Ac 8:13,21-23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-46","title":"2 Samuel 22:46","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":46,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":46},"content":"<p>fade away. Isa 64:6; Jas 1:11 out. Isa 2:19,21; Am 9:3; Mic 7:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-47","title":"2 Samuel 22:47","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":47,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":47},"content":"<p>Lord. De 32:39,40; Job 19:25 the rock of. Ps 89:26; Lu 1:47</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-48","title":"2 Samuel 22:48","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":48,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":48},"content":"<p>avengeth me. Heb. giveth avengement for me. 18:19,31; 1Sa 25:30; Ps 94:1 that bringeth. Ps 110:1; 144:2; 1Co 15:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-49","title":"2 Samuel 22:49","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":49,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":49},"content":"<p>thou also. 5:12; 7:8,9; Nu 24:7,17-19; 1Sa 2:8; Ps 18:48 the violent. Ps 52:1; 140:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-50","title":"2 Samuel 22:50","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":50,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":50},"content":"<p>among. Ro 15:9 I will sing. Ps 18:49; 145:1,2; 146:1,2; Isa 12:1-6</p>"},{"id":"tsk-2sa-22-51","title":"2 Samuel 22:51","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"2SA","chapterStart":22,"verseStart":51,"chapterEnd":22,"verseEnd":51},"content":"<p>the tower. 2; Ps 3:3; 21:1; 48:3; 89:26; 91:2; 144:10 his anointed. Ps 18:50; 89:20 seed. 7:12,13; Ps 18:50; 89:29,36; Jer 30:9; Lu 1:31-33; Re 11:15</p>"}]}